        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Olaiguanani Hosea le Israel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore to lari le tomon oare le nkitoria e Ahas olaiguanani le Yuda, neiteru Hosea olayioni le Elan aitoreisho te Samaria, neitore ninye Isiraeli. Neitoreisho ninye ilarin ooudo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neas ninye mbaa torrok too nkonyek o Laitoriani, kake eitu sii etiu anaa ilaiguanak le Israel apa ootii te dukuya ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelotu Shalmanesa olaiguanani le Asiria agilunore ninye. Neaku Hoshea osinka lenye, nelaaki ninye kodi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake enoto apa olaiguanani le Asiria enkitang'oroto te Hoshea; amu eirriwaka apa ninye ilkiliku Soo, olaiguanani le Misiri, neitu eitoki alaaki ninye kodi anaa apa enataasa too larin oo tulusoitie. Ore enkaraki ina neikenoo olaiguanani le Asiria ninye, neen tiatua korokoroni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Embatatata e Samaria",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki olaiguanani le Samaria aibung ina kop pooki, nelotu Samaria, ore too larin okuni, neman Samaria agadu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore to lari lioudo le nkitoria e Hoshea, neibung olaiguanani le Asiria Samaria, neya Isiraeli ootii Asiria nepik ninche enkanasa e Hala o embata olkeju le Habo, o olkeju le Gosan, o atua nkanas oo Lmedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netiu neijia, amu etaasa apa iltung'ana le Israel eng'oki tialo Olaitoriani Enkai enye, laa ninye oitayio ninche aitung'uaa enkop e Misiri, neitupuku te nkaina e Farao olaiguanani le Misiri. Eteserema ninche kulie aitin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neibung olkerreti le lelo oreren apa ootarayie Olaitoriani te dukuya iltung'ana le Israel, neibung lelo kerreti ooiteng'enishote ilaiguanak le Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Negolong'aki iltung'ana le Israel too nkisudorot mbaa torrok naaiba Olaitoriani Enkai enye, neas mbaa torrok. Eteshetakita ninche ate iwuejitin neeika too nkang'itie enye pooki, ebaiki oltalet ometabaiki enkanasa nasheta isunta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.14.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ilai 14.23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Etipikakitia ninche ate ing'apeta o Asherim te pooki doinyo naado, o tiabori pooki shani onyori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore teine nepuo aapejoo enkorropil too wuejitin pooki neeika anaa apa enataasa lelo oshon ooiwuang'ie Olaitoriani te dukuya ninche. Neas ninche mbaa torrok neitagor Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neisiaai naa ninche nkitanyaanyukot naa ninche apa etiaakinye Olaitoriani ninche, “Emiaas intae ena.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake sii eikoo apa Olaitoriani Israel o Yuda te pooki oiboni le Nkai, o te pooki aduaani, ejo, “Embelekenyata entapaash nkoitoi inyi torrok, nimbung'ubung'u nkitanapat aainei, o nkikoot aainei, te risioroto e nena kitanapat apa naitanapa loo papaai linyi, o nena nairriwaka intae too sinkan laaainei, lelo oiboonok le Nkai.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake eitu ninche ening, kake etogolong'akita anaa apa loo menye, amu eitu apa eiruk Olaitoriani Enkai enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etemenaitie ninche nkikoot enyena, oilo sotua lenye apa oitobira o loo menye o nena kikoot naaishoo ninye ninche. Eshomo ninche aasujaa nkitanyaanyukot neme Enkai, neaku ilootapong'ori, neibung ninche olkerreti le lelo oshon oomanita ninche, laa ninche apa eitanapa Olaitoriani nchere pee metiu anaa ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.12.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Int 12.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nepaash ninche nkitanapat pooki o Laitoriani Enkai enye, neitobiraki ate nkitanyaanyukot naasholuno oo lasho oare, neitobir Asherim, neserem olorora pooki le shumata, neisiaai Baal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.18.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 18.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nepejoo ilayiok lenye o ntoyie enye anaa ilasarri, neasishore ninche enaibon o esakutore, nemir ate pee etum aataas entorroni too nkonyek o Laitoriani, neitagor ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki ina etagorokine Olaitoriani Isiraeli oleng, neiwuang'ie ninche te dukuya ninche; eitu eing'uari toki meteleku olosho le Yuda ake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eitu apa sii ninye eibung Yuda nkitanapat o Laitoriani Enkai enye, kake eibung'a ilo kerreti apa oiteng'en Isiraeli ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neany Olaitoriani eishoi e Israel pooki, nepik ninche osina, nepik ninche atua nkaik oo lainyalak, ometaba anaa nenang'aa ninche aiwuang'ie te dukuya enye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee eidip aiwuang'ie Isiraeli te nkaji e Daudi, neitaa ninche Yeroboam olayioni le Nebat olaiguanani. Nerikoo Yeroboam Isiraeli aitapaash esujata o Laitoriani, nerikoki ninche metaasa eng'oki sapuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eturubare iltung'ana le Israel nena ng'ok pooki apa naataasa Yeroboam. Eitu ninche epaash nena ng'ok, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ometaba anaa neiwuang'ie Olaitoriani Isiraeli too nkonyek enyena, anaa apa enairoro aimunye isinkan lenyena lelo oibonok le Nkai. Neaku eshomo Isiraeli eararoto, neing'uaa enkop enye maate nepuo Asiria, netoni teine ometabaiki ena olong.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etamanya iltung'ana le Asiria enkop e Israel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyau olaiguanani le Asiria iltung'ana ooing'uaa Babilon, Kuta, o Afa, o Hamat, o Shefafaim, nepik ninche nkanas e Samaria, terishata oo ltung'ana le Israel. Neya ninche Samaria nebik too nkanas enyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te nkiterunoto e manyisho enye teine, neitu ninche eureyu Olaitoriani ore enkaraki ina neirriwaki Olaitoriani ilng'atunyo atua ninche, neinos lelo ng'atunyo kulikae lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelikini olaiguanani le Asiria aajoki, “Ore lelo oshon apa liwa te araroto nilo apik nkanas e Asiria, meyiolo ninche nkitanapat e Nkai eina kop. Ore enkaraki ina eirriwayie ninye ilng'atunyo atua ninche, naa ng'ura, earita ninche iltung'ana metuata. Amu meyiolo ninche nkitanapata e Nkai eina kop.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki olaiguanani le Asiria aitanapisho ajo, “Erriwai ine obo loo lapolosak apa litaaraitie ninchosho ninye meshomo abik teine; pee eiteng'enisho nkitanapat e Nkai eina kop.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eewuo obo le lelo apolosak apa ootaarayioki te Samaria nelotu abik te Betel, neiteng'en ninche eneiko teneureyu Olaitoriani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake meetae apa olosho lemeitobir nkaitin enye maate, nepik ninche nkajijik oo wuejitin neeika apa naaitobira ltung'ana le Samaria, nepik ake olosho nena anas apa naabikie ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore iltung'ana le Babilon neitobir Sukot-be-not. Ore iltung'ana le Kut, neitobir Nergal, ore iltung'ana le Hamat, neitobir Ashima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore iltung'ana le Efrit neitayu Nibas o Tarka; ore iltung'ana le Sefafit nenukaa nkera enye tenkaraki Adramalek o Anamelek nena aitin e Shefafaim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etureita sii apa ninche Olaitoriani, negelaki ate mpukunot pooki oo ltung'ana aaitaa ilapolosak loo wuejitin neeika, pee eitayu ilasarri too wuejitin neeika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku etureita ninche Olaitoriani kake eisiaayia sii nkaitin enye maate, aasujaa orrekie le lelo oshon apa oo tarayioki aaya eararoto tenebo ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.32.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 32.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.35.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "35.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore ebaiki ena olong neas ninche ilo rrekie apake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meure ninche Olaitoriani, nemerubare ninche nkikoot anaa nkiguanat, anaa nkitanapat apa naaitanapa Olaitoriani nkera e Yakobo laa ninye apa etejoki Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ena 20.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 5.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Eitobira apa Olaitoriani olning'o lo sotua o ninche, neitanap ninche ajoki, “Miureyuyu intae kulie aitin, nimirrugokinono ninche anaa isiaayiayia ninche, anaa ipolosakiki ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.6.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 6.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kake Olaitoriani entureita laa ninye apa oyawua intae aitupuku te nkop e Misiri, te ngolon kitok, o te nkaina naitoriori. Ninye errugokinoto, naa ninye entopolosaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore nena kikoot o nkiguenat, oina kitanapata apa naigeroki intae, entaas entobiraki. Miureyuyu intae kulie aitin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niminchosho erikino intae osotua lai apa laitobiraka intae. Miureyuyu intae kulie aitin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake entureita Olaitoriani Enkai inyi, naa kekordu ninye intae aitupuku too nkaik oo lmang'ati linyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake eyia, mening'isho ninche, kake etaasa ninche te risioroto olkerreti lenye liopa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eteserema apa kulo oshon neisiaai sii nkaitin oo nkitanyaanyukot naaguetuno, neijia sii eikununo nkera enye, o nkera oo nkera enye. Ore apa enataasa loo menye, neas sii ninche ina ometabaiki ena olong.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
